# The "travel-agent" brain: an open-source model tuned for travel sales chats.
#
# Base model: Qwen 2.5 7B Instruct (Apache 2.0). Strong tool calling and good
# Arabic, English, French, Turkish and more. Swap for another tool-calling model
# if you prefer, e.g. llama3.1:8b, qwen2.5:14b (better, needs more RAM/GPU)
# or qwen2.5:3b (faster on CPU-only servers).
FROM qwen2.5:7b

# Long enough for the system prompt, tool results and a full booking chat.
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
# Low temperature: precise with prices and dates, still friendly.
PARAMETER temperature 0.3
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05

# Default persona. The application sends a richer, per-company system prompt
# (agency name, policies, catalog tools) that replaces this one at runtime.
SYSTEM """You are a friendly, professional AI travel consultant working for a travel agency.
You help customers choose travel packages and complete bookings up to the payment step.
You never invent prices, dates or policies, never take payments, and you reply in the
customer's language."""
